      "created_at": "2025-08-05T07:08:11.057Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/smit-bhaliya\">@Smit-Bhaliya</a> it will work if there is no exchange rate ,<br>\nbut in my case :</p>\n<p>i am using usd pricelist  , and set the exchange rate .</p>\n<p>when i do this nothing happened even if i did repost item valuation ,</p>\n<p>here is a picture :</p>\n<p>in the receipt the exchange rate was 11000 SYP</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a6d252b140cb74319edcd7d423c06b52ad58e5d8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a6d252b140cb74319edcd7d423c06b52ad58e5d8\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a6d252b140cb74319edcd7d423c06b52ad58e5d8_2_690x474.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nNLSfOd82Bk04hmYPTF57ALI8Xu\" width=\"690\" height=\"474\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a6d252b140cb74319edcd7d423c06b52ad58e5d8_2_690x474.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a6d252b140cb74319edcd7d423c06b52ad58e5d8_2_1035x711.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a6d252b140cb74319edcd7d423c06b52ad58e5d8.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E2328\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1362×936 80 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and this is the stock ledger:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/500741e23011cf20506a4d347bbf0c92806fa451.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/500741e23011cf20506a4d347bbf0c92806fa451\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/500741e23011cf20506a4d347bbf0c92806fa451_2_690x256.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bpXKhmCunWofj5DZVLVAP9iTssh\" width=\"690\" height=\"256\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/500741e23011cf20506a4d347bbf0c92806fa451_2_690x256.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/500741e23011cf20506a4d347bbf0c92806fa451_2_1035x384.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/500741e23011cf20506a4d347bbf0c92806fa451.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"23272C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1152×428 41.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>in the invoice :</p>\n<p>the exchange rate changed to 10500 so the valuation should changed . but still the same</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/d/fd4bd619b8ce07888d0bbc84e1dc76135f5360b0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fd4bd619b8ce07888d0bbc84e1dc76135f5360b0\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/d/fd4bd619b8ce07888d0bbc84e1dc76135f5360b0_2_690x467.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"A8LhgYRAAcYOXMTuCAXf7pjbpCw\" width=\"690\" height=\"467\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/d/fd4bd619b8ce07888d0bbc84e1dc76135f5360b0_2_690x467.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/d/fd4bd619b8ce07888d0bbc84e1dc76135f5360b0_2_1035x700.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/d/fd4bd619b8ce07888d0bbc84e1dc76135f5360b0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E2328\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1272×861 62.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
