    {
      "id": 476347,
      "username": "hayyan_daood",
      "name": "hayyan daood",
      "created_at": "2025-08-05T09:52:45.294Z",
      "cooked": "<p>the best approach to solve this problem is to make landed cost voucher for the purchase receipt to adjust the valuation difference .</p>\n<p>go to invoice and see the accounting ledger :</p>\n<p>This is an <em>Exchange Loss</em>. A credit entry here means your valuation rate (e.g., exchange rate) increased the liability or the inventory cost compared to the original value when you received the stock.</p>\n<p>value = 32000</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/6/56164d4402947f3c993448812fa051e388ec0f3b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/56164d4402947f3c993448812fa051e388ec0f3b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/6/56164d4402947f3c993448812fa051e388ec0f3b_2_690x380.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"chyQjTx9BT21ssR4MmRNzARwtQv\" width=\"690\" height=\"380\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/6/56164d4402947f3c993448812fa051e388ec0f3b_2_690x380.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/6/56164d4402947f3c993448812fa051e388ec0f3b_2_1035x570.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/6/56164d4402947f3c993448812fa051e388ec0f3b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"25282E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1146×632 72.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>in the landed cost voucher :</p>\n<p>make the difference -32000</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/84fd0bf149a2d12f108a8e7c3c5d16efedf5c1fa.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/84fd0bf149a2d12f108a8e7c3c5d16efedf5c1fa\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/84fd0bf149a2d12f108a8e7c3c5d16efedf5c1fa_2_690x410.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iYtaUJ4KNBwPk1di7d9fqVrYvV0\" width=\"690\" height=\"410\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/84fd0bf149a2d12f108a8e7c3c5d16efedf5c1fa_2_690x410.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/84fd0bf149a2d12f108a8e7c3c5d16efedf5c1fa_2_1035x615.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/84fd0bf149a2d12f108a8e7c3c5d16efedf5c1fa.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"20252A\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1193×710 73.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and the stock ledger will be updated by new valuation rate</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/e/fe499b3be3afea8acc7d3a1d99a216ff198fc458.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fe499b3be3afea8acc7d3a1d99a216ff198fc458\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/e/fe499b3be3afea8acc7d3a1d99a216ff198fc458_2_689x226.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"AhwYF7ZBEBMAHMO0GS9JleyjDpC\" width=\"689\" height=\"226\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/e/fe499b3be3afea8acc7d3a1d99a216ff198fc458_2_689x226.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/e/fe499b3be3afea8acc7d3a1d99a216ff198fc458_2_1033x339.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/e/fe499b3be3afea8acc7d3a1d99a216ff198fc458.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"22262B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1346×442 38.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
